message: "If you use this software or the accompanying author-created data/figures, please cite the public v1.0.0 release. A Zenodo DOI has not yet been assigned; use the repository URL until the archival DOI is available."
type: software
title: "HAPS aerial data center: cross-layer LLM inference reproduction code"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-30
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Byeongheon
  - family-names: Ko
    given-names: Young-Chai
repository-code: "https://github.com/BHlee1013/haps-aerial-data-center"
abstract: "Reproduction software, author-generated reference data, manuscript figures and validation evidence for Direct wireless large language model inference from high-altitude platform stations under payload constraints. The public v1.0.0 package includes the validated raw BurstGPT session-pairing path, 1000-replicate day-level bootstrap, corrected seven-row Supplementary Table 6 export, corrected 1.275-kW Fig. 5d artwork, downstream reference reproduction, and the previously validated two-point Simscape boundary test."
keywords:
  - HAPS
  - non-terrestrial networks
  - large language models
  - exact reliability
  - payload feasibility
